# Local WordPress connection

- The live site is `https://mdsindustrialcorp.com`.
- Read credentials only from `.mds/wp.json` (gitignored). Never copy that file into the repo, README, tasks, or chat.
- Never print `user`, `secret`, Authorization headers, or the file contents.
- Use `python3 scripts/wp_connect.py status` to verify. Public name and auth ok/fail are enough.
